Atlas Payment Summary

1. Implementation, Customisation & Deployment: R20,000 once-off
2. Annual Atlas Licence & Support: R30,000 per year, paid upfront
3. Atlas Application Charge: Tiered per successfully paid application, billed annually in arrears

| Paid applications per year | Fee per application |
| -------------------------: | ------------------: |
|                  1 – 1,000 |                 R20 |
|              1,001 – 3,000 |             R17/R18 |
|              3,001 – 7,500 |             R14/R16 |
|             7,501 – 15,000 |             R11/R14 |
|            15,001 – 30,000 |              R9/R12 |
|            30,001 - 45,000 |              R6/R10 |
|                    45.000+ |               R3/R8 |

Firebase / Google Cloud infrastructure: Paid directly by the college.


Implementation, Customisation & Deployment

| Date                      | Payment / Event                                                          |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| When first going live     | R20,000 Implementation, Customisation & Deployment fee paid once-off     |

Annual Licence & Application Charges

| Date                        | Payment / Event                                                                                                         |
| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
|     1 January-30 November   | R30,000(or less depending on which month they went live) Annual Atlas Licence & Support for the current year is paid    |
|     1 January – 30 November | Application cycle operates and successfully paid applications accumulate                                                |
|     30 November             | Application cycle and annual application-volume period close                                                            |
|     1–30 December           | Atlas Application Charge for the current year is paid based on the final number of successfully paid applications       |
|     1 January               | R30,000 Annual Atlas Licence & Support for the new year is paid                                                         |
|     1 January – 30 November | New application cycle operates and successfully paid applications accumulate                                            |
|     30 November             | New application cycle and annual application-volume period close                                                        |
|     1–30 December           | Atlas Application Charge for the completed year is paid based on the final number of successfully paid applications     |
|     1 January/next year     | R30,000 Annual Atlas Licence & Support for the new year is paid                                                         |
